Flash, watch, and probe ESP32 boards from the terminal.
v0.1.1 • agent-friendly hardware workbench

  Boards: /dev/ttyUSB0
  Probe:  not connected
  Agents: pogo mcp + -f json

                        Menu
  [1]  Devices             List connected boards and probes
  [2]  Doctor              Check drivers, permissions, and config
  [3]  Flash & Run         Flash an ELF, reset, and watch it boot
  [4]  Serial Monitor      Watch the board's serial output (Ctrl-C to stop)
  [5]  Reset Board         Reboot the board into its app
  [6]  Run Tests           Run a pogo-test.toml suite on the board
  [7]  Set Up Claude Code  Register pogo as an MCP server for Claude Code
  [8]  Start MCP Server    Serve the tools over HTTP on 127.0.0.1:7646 (Ctrl-C to stop)
  [9]  Quickstart Guide    Command cheat sheet for terminals and agents
  [0]  Exit                Close pogo
